  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rinderpest Biological Threat Reduction in the Post-eradication Era - Phase III (International preparedness covering expansion of Rinderpest Vaccine Reserves and strengthening global coordination).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support efforts for improved preparedness and reducing the risk of rinderpest re-emergence by: i) strengthening coordination and collaboration among the relevant stakeholders to reduce the  Rinderpest Virus Containing Material (RVCM) , and ii) expanding Rinderpest Vaccine Reserves (RVR)</narrative>
